.TH SYSTEM-UPGRADE 1 "September 2026" "system-upgrade 2.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
system-upgrade \- show a Plasma alert when APT or Flatpak updates exist
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B system-upgrade
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B system-upgrade
refreshes APT metadata, checks APT and system/user Flatpak sources, and shows a
compact alert only when at least one update is available. Choosing Update opens
Plasma Discover. Casper live sessions are ignored.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/xdg/autostart/system-upgrade.desktop
.br
Starts the check with the Plasma session.
.PP
.I /etc/sudoers.d/system-upgrade
.br
Allows only the fixed APT metadata refresh command without a password.
